Goal

Build a to-do list app that supports tagging, filtering, and persistent storage.
Requirements
Core features

    Add a task with:

        task name (required)

        optional tag (example: school, work, personal)

    Display tasks in a list

    Mark tasks complete

    Delete tasks

Filters

    Filter by:

        All

        Active

        Completed

    Filter by tag (dropdown or buttons)

Persistence

    All tasks must persist using localStorage

    On reload, tasks must reappear correctly

Validation and UX

    Show an error message if task name is blank

    Clear the form after a successful add

    Show a small counter: “3 active tasks”

Suggested data model

Each task should look like:
{
id: 1700000000000,
text: "Finish Module 7 assignment",
tag: "school",
done: false
}


